# Allowlist, not a blocklist. This repository publishes the userscripts and
# nothing else: the working notes, datasets and scraping tools that live
# beside them in the same folder stay local. Ignoring everything first and
# then un-ignoring by name means a new file is private until it is named
# here, which is the right default when the folder also holds measurements
# tied to a Neopets account.
*

!.gitignore
!LICENSE
!README.md
!*.user.js
